# Root phase gates

- Implement one phase at a time from `docs/Implementation_phases.md`.
- After a phase gate is green, write `docs/phase/phase-N.md` and stop for manual review.
- Do not start the next phase until the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer `pnpm root-cli` for local CLI invocation; never rely on `pnpm root` (pnpm reserved).
- No AI/LLM features in the product; keep scaffolding deterministic.
